OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOwners call for 'right to
OL,4,Achallenge' property service charges
OL,5,Aafter fees treble
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of apartment owners are calling
OL,8,Ffor the "right to challenge" property
OL,9,Fservice charges after their annual fees
OL,10,Fhave more than trebled since 2018.
OL,12,FSome residents of Lisburn Square say
OL,13,Ftheir service charges were about #1,400
OL,14,Fper annum in 2018, but the figure has
OL,15,Frisen to more than #4,300 for the last
OL,16,Ffinancial year.
OL,18,FThe owners of the leasehold flats pay a
OL,19,Fservice charge to the managing agent,
OL,20,FAmbit CRE, for the maintenance, repairs
OL,21,Fand management of shared or communal
OL,22,Fareas as well as insurance.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
