OL,3,GNEWSAOwners call for 'right to
OL,4,Achallenge' property service charges
OL,5,Aafter fees treble
OL,6,
OL,7,FLisburn Square No 2, the apartment
OL,8,Fowners' landlord, said it was the
OL,9,F"largest individual contributor to the
OL,10,Fservice charge" and that all
OL,11,Fexpenditure was audited.
